From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Mizu: The Windows 11 style.

A fourth size of the visual style, "Windows 11": rounded push buttons,
check boxes, radio buttons, combo boxes, edit fields, thin scroll bars, round
sliders, progress bars, tabs, group boxes and toolbar buttons, in the light
and in the dark scheme, and the font Inter. Title bars and the taskbar stay
as they are. Its pictures and INI files are made by tools/make-win11-mizu.py;
the Personalization page (startui.dll) chooses between the two styles.
---
